# public-safe-lint suppressions (panelist#120)
#
# bare-issue-ref: these files carry legitimate bare `#N` references to
# panelist's own already-public issue/PR history inside source-code or
# workflow comments (never markdown prose). Rewriting a `.mjs`/`.yml`
# comment into a `[#N](...)` markdown link would not render as a link there
# and would just add noise, so each is exempted by exact path rather than
# rewritten. Prose docs (CHANGELOG.md, README.md, eval/README.md) were
# fixed instead -- see the panelist#120 PR body for the split.
